# Keep the build context lean. The image builds from source and initialises
# genesis at first boot, so none of this is needed inside it.
#
# Note what is NOT excluded: docs/static is embedded by docs/docs.go with
# //go:embed, so excluding it breaks the build with "pattern static: no matching
# files found". third_party carries the verifier sources and checksums.
.git
.github
build
